</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00034/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只自我收容的逆模因家猫（<em>Felis catus</em>），无法被标准认知阻值低于13者察觉。在叼走客座研究员Rachud的早餐后因后者在工作中使用了记忆强化剂而发现。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2015/██/█<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-75附近<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>在站点员工的<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">胁迫</span>意愿下，研究员Rachud利用工作之便诱导其每天定时从Site-CN-75-B一处后门中获取食物，食物的费用由所有员工共同负担。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>莫名其妙，看不见的猫有什么好吸的。</em>——研究员Rachud</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00034" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00034" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00034-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rachud" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4516971); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4516971&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609123007" alt="Rachud" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4516971)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rachud" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4516971); return false;">Rachud</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586172967 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 Apr 2020 11:36</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00461/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一本███页的小说，每次打开时名称、内容、人名和对话都会转变为其他小说的内容<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██街新华书店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的图书室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>古之帝王一把抓住李狗蛋的脖子？——正在新华书店买书的研究员guzl</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00461" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00461" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00461-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guzl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6264210); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6264210&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609123007" alt="guzl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6264210)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guzl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6264210); return false;">guzl</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1605343870 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">14 Nov 2020 08:51</span></p>
